From fce5aef7ff346f148dc2f32d94719c1b31125d52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:37:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add optional Microsoft Clarity and short UTM redirects

- analytics.js: load Clarity only on production, never for internal visits,
  and only when CLARITY_ID is filled in. No consent signal is sent, so for
  EEA/UK/CH visitors Clarity stays off.
- vercel.json: /ig and /li redirect to the home page with UTM parameters,
  so the Instagram bio link stays short.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0192CyRprtY8qGTFceYePUVJ
---
